{"seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/StateManagement","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/ThemingGuide","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/StatusBarGuide","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/AppearanceAndColors","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/Preferences","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/CustomViews","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/KeyboardShortcuts","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/PaletteReference","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/ListAndTable","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/LayoutSystem"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Guides","title":"Guides"}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"text":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"TUIkit provides a focus system that lets users move between interactive views (buttons, menus, text fields) using Tab, Shift+Tab, or arrow keys. The system consists of three parts:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"FocusManager"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Tracks which element is focused, handles navigation"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/Focusable"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Protocol that views adopt to receive focus"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/FocusState","type":"reference"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Lightweight state object that views use to query and request focus"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"text":"How Focus Works","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"How-Focus-Works"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Every frame, the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"FocusManager"},{"text":" is cleared and interactive views re-register themselves during rendering. This means focus registrations are always in sync with the current view tree: removed views are automatically unregistered.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The focus order follows the rendering order: the first focusable view rendered is first in the Tab cycle."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"The Focusable Protocol","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"The-Focusable-Protocol"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Views that want to receive focus conform to ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/Focusable","isActive":true},{"text":":","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["public protocol Focusable: AnyObject {","    var focusID: String { get }","    var canBeFocused: Bool { get }","    func onFocusReceived()","    func onFocusLost()","    func handleKeyEvent(_ event: KeyEvent) -> Bool","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"focusID"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": Unique identifier for this focusable element","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"canBeFocused","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": Whether focus can move to this element (default: "},{"code":"true","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":")"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"onFocusReceived()"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": Called when this element gains focus (default: no-op)"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"onFocusLost()"}]},{"text":": Called when this element loses focus (default: no-op)","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"handleKeyEvent(_:)","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": Handle a key event while focused; return "},{"code":"true","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" if consumed"}]}]}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A default extension provides sensible defaults for "},{"code":"canBeFocused","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" ("},{"code":"true","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"), "},{"code":"onFocusReceived()","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", and "},{"code":"onFocusLost()","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" (both no-ops). Only "},{"code":"focusID","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"code":"handleKeyEvent(_:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" must be implemented."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Using FocusState","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Using-FocusState"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/FocusState","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" is the user-facing API for checking and requesting focus inside a view:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["let focusState = FocusState(id: \"my-button\", focusManager: context.environment.focusManager)","","\/\/ Check if this element is currently focused","if focusState.isFocused {","    \/\/ render with focus indicator","}","","\/\/ Programmatically request focus","focusState.requestFocus()"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Built-in views like ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/Button","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/Menu","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" create their own ","type":"text"},{"code":"FocusState","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" internally: you only need it when building custom focusable views.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Navigation Keys","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Navigation-Keys"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"FocusManager"},{"type":"text","text":" responds to these keys during dispatch:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"rows":[[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Key","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Action","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Tab","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Move focus to the next element","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Shift+Tab"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Move focus to the previous element"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Arrow Down \/ Right"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Move focus to the next element"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Arrow Up \/ Left"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Move focus to the previous element","type":"text"}]}]]],"type":"table","header":"row"},{"text":"FocusRegistration Helper","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"FocusRegistration-Helper"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Built-in interactive views use the internal "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"FocusRegistration"},{"type":"text","text":" helper to avoid boilerplate. It handles three tasks in one call:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"orderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Persist a focus ID","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" via ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"StateStorage"},{"text":" so it remains stable across renders","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Register"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" the handler with the "},{"code":"FocusManager","type":"codeVoice"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Query"}]},{"type":"text","text":" whether this view currently has focus"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Custom views that implement ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/Focusable","type":"reference"},{"text":" typically do not need ","type":"text"},{"code":"FocusRegistration","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" directly. It is used by the framework’s ","type":"text"},{"code":"_*Core","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" views (e.g. ","type":"text"},{"code":"_ButtonCore","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"_ListCore","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":").","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Focus Indicator","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Focus-Indicator"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The visual indicator depends on the view type. Buttons and similar controls use a ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"highlight background bar"}]},{"text":" for the focused item. Text fields use ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"pulsing vertical bars"}]},{"text":" (caps) around the input area. Lists and tables use a ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"highlight background"}]},{"text":" for the focused row, with a ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"pulsing accent background","type":"text"}]},{"text":" when the row is both focused and selected.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Focus in the Event Loop","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Focus-in-the-Event-Loop"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Focus dispatch happens in Layer 2 of the key event pipeline (see ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/AppLifecycle","isActive":true},{"text":"):","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"orderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A key event arrives from stdin"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Layer 1 (status bar) gets first chance to handle it"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Layer 2: ","type":"text"},{"code":"KeyEventDispatcher","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" dispatches to the focused view’s ","type":"text"},{"code":"handleKeyEvent(_:)","type":"codeVoice"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If not consumed, navigation keys (Tab, arrows) are handled by "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"FocusManager"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Layer 3 (default bindings) handles quit, theme cycling, etc."}]}]}]}],"kind":"content"}],"kind":"article","sections":[],"abstract":[{"text":"Navigate between interactive elements using the keyboard.","type":"text"}],"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Article","modules":[{"name":"TUIkit"}],"role":"article","title":"Focus System"},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/tuikit\/focussystem"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/FocusSystem","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"references":{"doc://TUIkit/documentation/TUIkit/FocusState":{"type":"topic","title":"FocusState","identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/FocusState","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Tracks focus state for a specific element.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"FocusState"}],"url":"\/documentation\/tuikit\/focusstate","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"FocusState"}]},"tuikit-logo.png":{"identifier":"tuikit-logo.png","type":"image","variants":[{"url":"\/images\/TUIkit\/tuikit-logo.png","traits":["1x","light"]}],"alt":"TUIkit 